# Noelle Furina Columbina Xingqiu. ~21s Rot. KQMS KurtC. Noelle Triple Hydro Lunar Crystallize. Columbina bursts every other rotation. AP Clears other set options.

# Team - Options ordered by DPS
noelle char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
